    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nBright and spacious penthouse one-bedroom apartment with resident parking, ideally positioned in the heart of Sandymount Village.\n\nSavills are delighted to present 9 Gilford Pines to the market, a superb penthouse one-bedroom apartment ideally positioned within this mature and highly sought after development in the heart of Sandymount. Occupying an elevated top-floor setting, the property is flooded with natural light and offers well-balanced accommodation designed for modern living. The interior comprises a spacious living and dining area, a well-appointed kitchen, a generous storage/cloak room, a large double bedroom and a contemporary bathroom.\n\nThe elevated position affords a wonderful sense of privacy, while large windows enhance the bright and welcoming atmosphere throughout. Resident parking further adds to the convenience and appeal of this attractive Dublin 4 home.\n\nSituated on Gilford Road, 9 Gilford Pines enjoys one of Sandymount's most sought-after and convenient residential settings. The property is within a short stroll of Sandymount Village, renowned for its excellent selection of cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities, while nearby Sandymount Strand offers a wonderful coastal amenity for walking, running and outdoor recreation. Sandymount DART Station is also within easy reach, providing swift and convenient access to Dublin City Centre and beyond.\n\nThe area is particularly popular with families due to its proximity to a number of highly regarded schools, including Star of the Sea BNS, Lakelands Girls National School, St. Matthew's National School and the recently established Shellybanks Educate Together. A superb range of sporting and leisure facilities are also close at hand, including Pembroke Cricket Club, Pembroke Wanderers Hockey Club, Monkstown Rugby Club, the Aviva Stadium and the RDS, home to the world-renowned Dublin Horse Show and Leinster Rugby. This exceptional combination of village charm, coastal living and first-class amenities makes Sandymount one of Dublin's most desirable addresses."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Penthouse one-bedroom apartment</li><li>Prime Sandymount location</li><li>Resident parking included</li><li>Presented in excellent condition throughout</li><li>Easy access to Dublin city centre</li><li>Short stroll to Sandymount Village</ul>"
